    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Forge-Blessed Tools.</strong> Your kit knows your hands and your hands know the kit.</p><ul><li>When you make checks using <strong>the Plating aptitude</strong> to craft, repair, reinforce, or sanctify items and structures, you are treated as especially capable. The GM may reroll the lowest die or a small bonus when the work is aligned with healing or protecting people (armor repair, shelter reinforcement, ritual fittings, etc.).</li><li>This feat marks you as a specialist Smith for the purposes of Bad Eden systems and any future automation that keys off Soul-Smith flags.</li></ul>",
